#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.gather.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.gather"
msgstr "cuda.tile.gather"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:1 of
msgid "Loads a tile from the `array` elements specified by `indices`."
msgstr "从 ``indices`` 指定的数组元素位置加载一个 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:3 of
msgid ""
"`indices` must be a tuple whose length equals the `array` rank. All "
"elements of this tuple must be integer tiles or scalars of the same "
"shape, or different shapes that are broadcastable to a common shape."
msgstr ""
"``indices`` 必须为长度等于 ``array`` "
"秩（rank）的元组。该元组的所有元素都必须是具有相同形状（或不同形状但可广播到同一公共形状）的整数 Tile 或标量。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:7 of
msgid "The result shape will be the same as the broadcasted shape of indices."
msgstr "结果形状将与索引广播后的形状一致。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:9 of
msgid ""
"For example, consider a 2-dimensional array. In this case, indices must "
"be a tuple of length 2. Suppose that ``ind0`` and ``ind1`` are integer "
"tiles of shapes ``(M, N, 1)`` and ``(M, 1, K)``. Then the result tile "
"will have the broadcasted shape ``(M, N, K)``::"
msgstr ""
"例如，考虑一个二维数组。此时 ``indices`` 必须是长度为 2 的元组。假设 ``ind0`` 和 ``ind1`` 分别是形状为 "
"``(M, N, 1)`` 和 ``(M, 1, K)`` 的整数 Tile，则结果 Tile 将具有广播后的形状 ``(M, N, K)`` ："
" ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:16 of
msgid "The result tile `t` will be computed according to ::"
msgstr "结果 Tile ``t`` 将按如下方式计算： ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:20 of
msgid ""
"If the array is 1-dimensional, `indices` can be passed as a tile rather "
"than a tuple. This is a convenience notation that is strictly equivalent "
"to passing a tuple of length 1::"
msgstr "如果数组为一维， ``indices`` 可以直接作为单个 Tile 传入，而无需包装为元组。这种便捷写法与传入长度为 1 的元组完全等价： ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:25 of
msgid ""
"A custom boolean `mask` can be provided to control which elements are "
"loaded. The mask must be a scalar or a tile whose shape is broadcastable "
"to the common shape of indices. Where the mask is ``False``, "
"`padding_value` is returned instead of loading from the array."
msgstr ""
"可提供自定义的布尔 ``mask`` 以控制加载哪些元素。掩码必须为标量或 Tile，且其形状须可广播到索引的公共形状。当掩码为 "
"``False`` 时，将直接返回 ``padding_value`` ，而不会从数组中读取。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:30 of
msgid ""
"`gather()` checks that indices are within the bounds of the array. For "
"indices that are out of bounds, `padding_value` will be returned (zero by"
" default). It must be a scalar or a tile whose shape is broadcastable to "
"the common shape of indices."
msgstr ""
"``gather()`` 会检查索引是否在数组边界内。对于越界索引，将返回 ``padding_value`` （默认为 0）。 "
"``padding_value`` 必须为标量或 Tile，其形状须可广播到索引的公共形状。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:34 of
msgid ""
"If both `mask` and `check_bounds=True` are provided, the effective mask "
"is the logical AND of both the custom mask and the bounds-checking mask. "
"This means an element is only loaded if both the custom mask is ``True`` "
"AND the index is within bounds."
msgstr ""
"如果同时提供了 ``mask`` 且设置了 ``check_bounds=True`` "
"，则最终生效的掩码为自定义掩码与边界检查掩码的逻辑与（AND）。这意味着只有当自定义掩码为 ``True`` "
"且索引位于边界内时，才会加载对应元素。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:38 of
msgid ""
"To disable bounds checking, set `check_bounds` to ``False``. In this "
"mode, the caller is responsible for ensuring that all indices are within "
"the bounds of the array, and any out-of-bounds access will result in "
"undefined behavior."
msgstr ""
"若要禁用边界检查，请将 ``check_bounds`` 设为 ``False`` "
"。在此模式下，调用方须负责确保所有索引均在数组边界内，任何越界访问都将导致未定义行为。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.gather:42 of
msgid ""
"Negative indices are interpreted as out of bounds, i.e. they don't follow"
" the Python's negative index convention."
msgstr "负索引将被视为越界，即不遵循 Python 的负索引惯例。"

